<title>ITALY: Spanish officials expect ERM deal at 990 lire - ANSA.</title>
<headline>Spanish officials expect ERM deal at 990 lire - ANSA.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish officials at European Union talks on the lira's re-entry into the Exchange rate mechanism said the Italian currency was expected to rejoin at 990 lire to the mark, Italian news agency ANSA reported from Brussels.</p>
<p>The sources said a bilateral meeting was under way to discuss the proposed compromise between the Irish presidency of the EU Council of Ministers and the French delegation attending the meeting of EU Finance Ministers and central bank governors.</p>
</text>
